WEBVTT

00:16.310 --> 00:19.920
<b>Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa</b>

00:19.920 --> 00:23.550
<b>Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru</b>

00:23.550 --> 00:27.550
<b>Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete</b>

00:30.930 --> 00:34.460
<b>Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga</b>

00:34.460 --> 00:38.130
<b>Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku</b>

00:38.130 --> 00:42.090
<b>Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase</b>

00:45.440 --> 00:52.680
<b>Tatoe hitori de mo kimi no
koto shinjite itai</b>

00:52.680 --> 00:59.960
<b>Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu</b>

00:59.960 --> 01:03.630
<b>Nani o mitsukete yukou</b>

01:03.630 --> 01:07.230
<b>Kokoro o hakidashite</b>

01:07.230 --> 01:14.500
<b>Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara</b>

01:14.500 --> 01:18.140
<b>Nani o mitsumete iyou</b>

01:18.140 --> 01:24.880
<b>Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o</b>

01:24.880 --> 01:28.650
<b>Let it go, Shinjiyou</b>

01:43.800 --> 01:48.070
<b>Hey, Sanzo, he's really following us.</b>

01:49.740 --> 01:51.270
<b>Don't mind him.</b>

01:51.270 --> 01:52.870
<b>But you know...</b>

01:52.870 --> 01:55.380
<b>Be quiet! Shut up and walk.</b>

01:55.380 --> 01:56.840
<b>Man...</b>

02:01.980 --> 02:05.420
<b>I'm truly grateful to you
for saving me.</b>

02:08.620 --> 02:11.430
<b>Perhaps this is my penitence.</b>

02:11.430 --> 02:13.690
<b>Your hair and your eyes...</b>

02:14.930 --> 02:16.900
<b>...remind me of blood.</b>

02:19.970 --> 02:25.810
<b>The crimson that stains my hands
has kept me grounded in reality,</b>

02:25.810 --> 02:30.350
<b>even as I try to escape
the weight of my sins.</b>

02:30.350 --> 02:35.410
<b>Your hair and your eyes
admonish me, Mr. Gojyo.</b>

02:39.220 --> 02:41.750
<b>I'm not very nice, am I?</b>

02:42.590 --> 02:44.560
<b>What's wrong, slowpoke?!
I'm gonna leave you behind!</b>

02:44.560 --> 02:46.220
<b>Bastard! I won't lose!</b>

02:48.500 --> 02:49.930
<b>Idiots.</b>

02:53.870 --> 02:55.340
<b>Just you wait, Cho Gonou.</b>

02:56.100 --> 02:59.100
<b>I'll make you look at my eyes
and hair again.</b>

03:00.310 --> 03:01.910
<b>He...</b>

03:01.910 --> 03:03.900
<b>He needs me.</b>

03:19.860 --> 03:21.520
<b>My wound opened up again.</b>

03:22.360 --> 03:23.830
<b>I guess it's not surprising.</b>

03:29.300 --> 03:31.400
<b>I wonder if Mr. Gojyo is okay?</b>

03:32.170 --> 03:34.570
<b>I caused him trouble to the very end.</b>

03:38.150 --> 03:40.670
<b>I brought the gun with me on impulse,</b>

03:42.120 --> 03:44.020
<b>but I guess I won't be able
to return it.</b>

03:48.220 --> 03:49.690
<b>Kanan...</b>

03:50.990 --> 03:53.390
<b>Kanan, at the very least...</b>

04:12.450 --> 04:15.280
<b>At the very least, if I could take
your remains in my arms...</b>

04:22.860 --> 04:24.430
<b>That is...</b>

04:24.430 --> 04:28.630
<b>Right, that's my older brother,
and you killed him!</b>

04:28.630 --> 04:30.570
<b>I've been looking for you, Cho Gonou!</b>

04:30.570 --> 04:32.470
<b>So I could give this to you!</b>

04:35.800 --> 04:37.140
<b>What's the matter?</b>

04:37.140 --> 04:40.230
<b>Nothing, just my imagination, right?</b>

04:46.950 --> 04:49.610
<b>Sanzo, are we really going
in the right direction?</b>

04:50.650 --> 04:55.020
<b>Yes, I have a pretty good idea
where Cho Gonou's headed.</b>

04:55.020 --> 04:57.630
<b>He's probably going to
Hyakugan Maoh's castle.</b>

04:57.630 --> 04:59.150
<b>Hyakugan Maoh?</b>

05:00.130 --> 05:02.790
<b>It's where he committed
his mass murder.</b>

05:04.430 --> 05:05.900
<b>Hey...</b>

05:07.170 --> 05:10.040
<b>What're you going to do with him
when you take him away?</b>

05:11.940 --> 05:14.210
<b>You seem quite devoted to him.</b>

05:14.210 --> 05:18.050
<b>Well, I did go to all that
trouble to save him.</b>

05:18.050 --> 05:20.210
<b>I can't have him die so easily on me.</b>

05:23.350 --> 05:26.820
<b>I don't know how Cho Gonou
will be dealt with either.</b>

05:26.820 --> 05:29.720
<b>The Sanbutsushin have
sole authority over that.</b>

05:30.530 --> 05:32.360
<b>Hey...</b>

05:32.360 --> 05:36.500
<b>Being one of the highest-ranking
monks, you know, don't you?</b>

05:36.500 --> 05:38.860
<b>You know what the color of my hair
and eyes mean, right?</b>

05:39.670 --> 05:42.140
<b>Between man and demon...</b>

05:42.140 --> 05:45.740
<b>A joining of the two different species
has been deemed taboo.</b>

05:45.740 --> 05:49.610
<b>It's said their children are born
with crimson eyes and hair.</b>

05:50.250 --> 05:52.410
<b>This is the color of blood.</b>

05:52.410 --> 05:55.980
<b>He said this color represented
penitence for him.</b>

05:59.050 --> 06:00.160
<b>I won't let him die.</b>

06:01.160 --> 06:04.990
<b>Even if this is just my ego talking,
I won't let him die!</b>

06:05.990 --> 06:07.400
<b>This is stupid.</b>

06:07.400 --> 06:08.630
<b>What?!</b>

06:08.630 --> 06:10.890
<b>What are you expecting
to get out of this?</b>

06:12.070 --> 06:14.700
<b>I don't care if it's taboo or what.</b>

06:14.700 --> 06:18.070
<b>Do you seriously think the only
red thing in this world is blood?</b>

06:18.910 --> 06:22.880
<b>If you do, then you may as well
just shave your head.</b>

06:22.880 --> 06:25.150
<b>I'll introduce you to a temple.</b>

06:25.150 --> 06:26.610
<b>No thanks.</b>

06:28.580 --> 06:30.850
<b>You stupid monkey! What the hell
are you doing?!</b>

06:30.850 --> 06:33.340
<b>Oh, it's cold after all.</b>

06:34.690 --> 06:37.660
<b>It's so red, like it's burning.</b>

06:37.660 --> 06:39.820
<b>I thought maybe it would be hot.</b>

06:40.460 --> 06:41.930
<b>What?</b>

06:42.600 --> 06:44.220
<b>What are you expecting
to get out of this?</b>

06:46.070 --> 06:48.340
<b>I let my hair grow out long,</b>

06:48.340 --> 06:51.070
<b>and now I'm trying to save
someone who needs me.</b>

06:51.710 --> 06:54.000
<b>The one who wants to be saved is me.</b>

06:55.710 --> 06:57.380
<b>What's wrong, Goku?</b>

06:57.380 --> 06:58.850
<b>I smell blood.</b>

07:00.550 --> 07:01.950
<b>Which way?</b>

07:01.950 --> 07:03.920
<b>Let's see... This way!</b>

07:03.920 --> 07:05.390
<b>Let's hurry!</b>

07:07.760 --> 07:11.160
<b>Do you remember?! The dead faces
of my family that you killed?!</b>

07:11.160 --> 07:14.800
<b>And the dead faces of my clan
that you killed?!</b>

07:14.800 --> 07:18.700
<b>We of the Dark Crow clan were being
threatened by Hyakugan Maoh</b>

07:18.700 --> 07:21.290
<b>and were forced to take your lover.</b>

07:21.970 --> 07:26.570
<b>For doing so, my clan would've
been allowed to live!</b>

07:26.570 --> 07:30.700
<b>With the sacrifice of one woman,
my clan would've been saved!</b>

07:31.450 --> 07:32.910
<b>But you...</b>

07:39.420 --> 07:42.510
<b>You took everything away from us
with your meaningless revenge!</b>

07:47.330 --> 07:48.800
<b>I'll do the same to you.</b>

07:49.760 --> 07:54.330
<b>I'll give you a taste of what
my clan suffered!</b>

07:55.500 --> 07:59.060
<b>I see, you wish to have your
revenge that badly?</b>

08:00.440 --> 08:04.040
<b>All right then, it's not a life
I'd miss anyway.</b>

08:07.580 --> 08:10.640
<b>I'll give you my right eye first.</b>

08:11.790 --> 08:14.190
<b>After that, my left eye.</b>

08:14.190 --> 08:16.490
<b>Then my right ear.</b>

08:16.490 --> 08:18.790
<b>Left ear, nose...</b>

08:18.790 --> 08:20.260
<b>Stop that!</b>

08:23.060 --> 08:24.550
<b>Your eye! Is your eye...</b>

08:27.440 --> 08:29.300
<b>What did you do that for?!</b>

08:30.810 --> 08:33.740
<b>I thought you had pretty eyes!</b>

08:35.040 --> 08:38.150
<b>I hear you said that red is
the color of penitence.</b>

08:38.150 --> 08:41.010
<b>Penitence to whom? The gods?</b>

08:43.050 --> 08:44.750
<b>The gods don't save anyone.</b>

08:45.320 --> 08:47.790
<b>You are the only one who
can save yourself.</b>

08:48.820 --> 08:51.990
<b>You can kill yourself if you want.
You can escape that way.</b>

08:52.890 --> 08:54.860
<b>Your death will change nothing.</b>

08:55.430 --> 08:58.490
<b>But there are some things that
will change if you are alive.</b>

09:01.340 --> 09:04.670
<b>Who the hell are you?! His friends?!</b>

09:04.670 --> 09:06.110
<b>No...</b>

09:06.810 --> 09:10.510
<b>You want to kill him, right? Then
continue what you were doing.</b>

09:10.510 --> 09:12.150
<b>We won't interfere.</b>

09:12.150 --> 09:15.350
<b>But those who kill others and live on</b>

09:15.350 --> 09:19.690
<b>must, at the same time, be prepared
to be killed themselves.</b>

09:19.690 --> 09:22.660
<b>That's the law of consequences.</b>

09:22.660 --> 09:26.390
<b>Well, I'm just repeating what some
stinking monk said to me once.</b>

09:26.390 --> 09:27.860
<b>Don't mess with me!</b>

09:36.670 --> 09:39.640
<b>They are all such idiots.</b>

09:39.640 --> 09:40.810
<b>Can you walk?</b>

09:40.810 --> 09:42.270
<b>I can manage.</b>

09:43.780 --> 09:45.780
<b>Hey!</b>

09:45.780 --> 09:47.250
<b>You're going, right?</b>

09:49.550 --> 09:51.450
<b>Hyakugan Maoh's castle.</b>

09:52.890 --> 09:54.460
<b>Here!</b>

09:54.460 --> 09:55.890
<b>It's yours, right?</b>

09:57.830 --> 09:59.330
<b>Kanan...</b>

09:59.330 --> 10:00.090
<b>Let's go!</b>

10:00.090 --> 10:01.560
<b>Oh, yes.</b>

10:03.000 --> 10:04.460
<b>Thank you.</b>

10:13.310 --> 10:14.780
<b>This is...</b>

10:16.180 --> 10:18.410
<b>It's the remains of Hyakugan
Maoh's castle.</b>

10:19.650 --> 10:23.050
<b>It seems someone set fire to it
a couple days ago.</b>

10:24.090 --> 10:25.640
<b>Nothing survived it.</b>

10:27.760 --> 10:29.220
<b>I see.</b>

10:30.430 --> 10:32.860
<b>Yet again, I was unable to save her.</b>

10:37.000 --> 10:40.700
<b>Hey, at least chant a sutra for her,
you stinking monk.</b>

10:42.270 --> 10:44.570
<b>Doing it wouldn't ease
his conscience any.</b>

10:45.540 --> 10:48.600
<b>But those things aren't about
what's logical, you know?</b>

10:53.050 --> 10:56.020
<b>I don't chant sutras for the dead.</b>

13:17.060 --> 13:21.390
<b>A clear voice that could dispel
any and all doubt.</b>

13:33.040 --> 13:34.470
<b>We...</b>

13:36.140 --> 13:39.110
<b>...gathered around this golden light.</b>

13:50.560 --> 13:51.830
<b>There's no need.</b>

13:51.830 --> 13:53.790
<b>But...</b>

13:53.790 --> 13:56.020
<b>It's all right. Please put them on.</b>

14:05.270 --> 14:07.710
<b>Priest Genjo Sanzo...</b>

14:09.010 --> 14:10.710
<b>Sinner Cho Gonou...</b>

14:11.510 --> 14:12.980
<b>Enter.</b>

14:16.850 --> 14:19.250
<b>It's so red, like it's burning.</b>

14:19.250 --> 14:21.120
<b>I thought maybe it would be hot.</b>

14:21.120 --> 14:24.060
<b>They all just say whatever
they feel like.</b>

14:24.890 --> 14:29.400
<b>Do you seriously think the only
red thing in this world is blood?</b>

14:29.400 --> 14:32.130
<b>Of course not, I know that.</b>

14:33.000 --> 14:35.040
<b>They're an admonishment to me.</b>

14:35.040 --> 14:37.500
<b>Then, I'll just cut it off.</b>

14:38.210 --> 14:40.440
<b>The one who wants to be saved is me.</b>

14:42.540 --> 14:45.940
<b>A couple of days ago, that
stinking monk told me.</b>

14:46.950 --> 14:48.620
<b>What do you want?!</b>

14:48.620 --> 14:50.990
<b>Cho Gonou is dead.</b>

14:50.990 --> 14:52.450
<b>What the hell?!</b>

14:53.020 --> 14:56.250
<b>You're the one who told him
to live! Well?!</b>

14:58.460 --> 15:01.900
<b>I told you before.
The gods save no one.</b>

15:01.900 --> 15:05.000
<b>No one can gainsay the fate he chose.</b>

15:05.000 --> 15:06.470
<b>Not you and not me.</b>

15:08.400 --> 15:12.430
<b>Man, it's the second time I've been
dumped by someone pretty.</b>

15:13.210 --> 15:15.480
<b>You thought that highly of yourself?</b>

15:15.480 --> 15:16.940
<b>Yeah, I guess.</b>

15:20.580 --> 15:22.050
<b>Gojyo?!</b>

15:23.680 --> 15:25.420
<b>Yo!</b>

15:25.420 --> 15:27.620
<b>What's up with your haircut?</b>

15:27.620 --> 15:29.320
<b>Oh, nothing much.</b>

15:29.320 --> 15:33.030
<b>You haven't shown your face
around the bar at all lately.</b>

15:33.030 --> 15:34.830
<b>Oh, I'll go.</b>

15:34.830 --> 15:37.630
<b>I've got no means of living other
than gambling after all.</b>

15:37.630 --> 15:39.670
<b>Oh, saying things like that again!</b>

15:39.670 --> 15:42.540
<b>Are you sure you didn't find a new
girlfriend or something?</b>

15:42.540 --> 15:44.000
<b>No way.</b>

15:45.610 --> 15:49.640
<b>But I got to know a blond beauty
with a dysfunctional personality,</b>

15:49.640 --> 15:52.450
<b>a shorty with a miniature brain,</b>

15:52.450 --> 15:57.120
<b>and an emotionally unstable,
unfortunate beauty.</b>

15:57.120 --> 15:59.820
<b>What? What's that supposed to mean?</b>

15:59.820 --> 16:01.060
<b>Later.</b>

16:01.060 --> 16:05.130
<b>Oh, wait, Gojyo! Oh!</b>

16:05.130 --> 16:07.530
<b>It's not like anything's changed.</b>

16:08.300 --> 16:09.860
<b>No matter how many times I cut it,</b>

16:09.860 --> 16:12.370
<b>the hair that grows back is still red.</b>

16:12.370 --> 16:14.990
<b>And the eyes reflected in the mirror
are always crimson too.</b>

16:15.740 --> 16:17.860
<b>But lately, I'm starting
to think that's okay.</b>

16:19.110 --> 16:22.080
<b>Miss, give me one of these.</b>

16:22.080 --> 16:23.210
<b>Yes!</b>

16:23.210 --> 16:26.580
<b>It's a beautiful red, isn't it, Gojyo?</b>

16:31.850 --> 16:34.980
<b>Miss, give me four instead.</b>

16:38.290 --> 16:40.830
<b>Wow, haven't seen you in a while!</b>

16:40.830 --> 16:42.830
<b>Hello, pardon me for bothering you.</b>

16:42.830 --> 16:46.370
<b>Hey, what's with your head, Gojyo?
It looks weird!</b>

16:46.370 --> 16:49.440
<b>Shut up, monkey. Here's some food.</b>

16:49.440 --> 16:50.900
<b>Oh, thanks.</b>

16:52.170 --> 16:54.470
<b>Hey, apples! They look good!</b>

16:55.040 --> 16:59.610
<b>Hey, you tricked me, you phony monk.</b>

16:59.610 --> 17:01.480
<b>What're you talking about?</b>

17:01.480 --> 17:03.470
<b>What am I talking about?</b>

17:04.790 --> 17:07.390
<b>Buddhism forbids killing.</b>

17:07.390 --> 17:10.880
<b>Don't tell me you thought we'd
summarily execute a criminal?</b>

17:11.530 --> 17:12.990
<b>All you had to do was think a little.</b>

17:13.530 --> 17:15.890
<b>I seriously wanna kill him right now.</b>

17:17.730 --> 17:20.170
<b>Then, are you free now?</b>

17:20.170 --> 17:24.230
<b>Yes, thanks to Mr. Sanzo's support.</b>

17:24.970 --> 17:28.880
<b>He interceded with the Sanbutsushin
on my behalf</b>

17:28.880 --> 17:31.750
<b>to let me discard the name of
Cho Gonou and start a new life.</b>

17:31.750 --> 17:33.680
<b>Then, what's your name now?</b>

17:34.720 --> 17:37.010
<b>Hakkai, it's Cho Hakkai.</b>

17:38.450 --> 17:43.060
<b>Hakkai... Yeah, it fits you better
than the one you had before!</b>

17:43.060 --> 17:44.520
<b>Do you think so?</b>

17:45.290 --> 17:48.230
<b>You probably can't remember it
with your deficient brain.</b>

17:48.230 --> 17:51.170
<b>Don't make fun of me!
It's Hakkai, right?!</b>

17:51.170 --> 17:54.740
<b>Hakkai! Hakkai! Hakkai! Hakkai!
Hakkai! Hakkai! Hakkai! Hakkai!</b>

17:54.740 --> 17:56.800
<b>Now, here's your question.</b>

17:56.800 --> 18:00.740
<b>How many times did
Goku say, "Hakkai?"</b>

18:00.740 --> 18:01.710
<b>Eight times.</b>

18:01.710 --> 18:03.610
<b>Bingo!</b>

18:03.610 --> 18:05.850
<b>So, what're you going to do now?</b>

18:05.850 --> 18:10.120
<b>I'll be rooming with Gojyo,</b>

18:10.120 --> 18:13.720
<b>because he doesn't even remember
the day for trash pickup.</b>

18:13.720 --> 18:16.120
<b>He just worries me to no end, so...</b>

18:16.120 --> 18:18.160
<b>Shut up! This's what a really
loud voice sounds like!</b>

18:18.160 --> 18:19.160
<b>He's less than a monkey.</b>

18:19.160 --> 18:20.460
<b>I've seen so much death,
but it's so strange.</b>

18:20.460 --> 18:22.660
<b>Shut up, you stupid idiot!
Mini-monkey!
I've seen so much death,
but it's so strange.</b>

18:24.770 --> 18:27.430
<b>Now, I'm frightened to die.</b>

18:27.970 --> 18:31.110
<b>Hakkai, I've got your name
memorized now,</b>

18:31.110 --> 18:32.570
<b>so you better not change it anymore!</b>

18:34.010 --> 18:35.480
<b>All right.</b>

18:37.080 --> 18:41.750
<b>So? Is that haircut your way of
putting the past behind you?</b>

18:41.750 --> 18:45.020
<b>Nope, I'm probably the same as him.</b>

18:45.020 --> 18:47.050
<b>Just a futile struggle.</b>

18:47.050 --> 18:50.290
<b>Life is basically a futile struggle
until you die anyway.</b>

18:51.690 --> 18:53.190
<b>What?</b>

18:53.190 --> 18:55.730
<b>Do I look good like this?</b>

18:55.730 --> 18:58.820
<b>It's a little better than the
obnoxious long hair.</b>

18:59.830 --> 19:01.700
<b>Then, I think I'll grow it out again.</b>

19:01.700 --> 19:04.410
<b>I'm pervy, so it grows fast too.</b>

19:04.410 --> 19:06.370
<b>You trying to pick a fight?!</b>

19:07.040 --> 19:08.510
<b>All right!</b>

19:09.510 --> 19:11.310
<b>Shall we go eat?!</b>

19:11.310 --> 19:13.550
<b>Yes! Yay! Yay! Food! Food!</b>

19:13.550 --> 19:15.640
<b>You're so noisy. Shut up!
Yes! Yay! Yay! Food! Food!</b>

19:16.550 --> 19:18.320
<b>Let's go, Sanzo.</b>

19:18.320 --> 19:20.650
<b>Don't be ridiculous!
Why do I have to...</b>

19:24.090 --> 19:25.560
<b>You better be treating.</b>

19:29.360 --> 19:31.630
<b>Oh, what wonderful weather!</b>

19:31.630 --> 19:33.500
<b>Perfect day for a field trip, right?</b>

19:33.500 --> 19:35.470
<b>That sounds good. We can
take lunch with us.</b>

19:35.470 --> 19:38.070
<b>Teacher! Are bananas for snack time?</b>

19:38.070 --> 19:41.170
<b>Quit it. I wouldn't go on a trip
with you guys if it killed me.</b>

19:47.880 --> 19:51.390
<b>That's what Sanzo said
three years ago,</b>

19:51.390 --> 19:53.390
<b>but it's turned into reality.</b>

19:53.390 --> 19:58.090
<b>Well, aren't you really glad
the rain let up, Sanzo?</b>

19:58.090 --> 20:02.290
<b>Why ask me? You're the one
who doesn't like the rain.</b>

20:04.270 --> 20:05.330
<b>You're right.</b>

20:05.330 --> 20:07.940
<b>What? Why do you both hate rain?</b>

20:07.940 --> 20:09.740
<b>You sure you're not hiding
something from me?</b>

20:09.740 --> 20:12.170
<b>What is it? What is it?
Come on, tell me!</b>

20:12.170 --> 20:12.910
<b>Shut up!</b>

20:12.910 --> 20:13.910
<b>Ow! What was that for?!
Shut up!</b>

20:13.910 --> 20:15.310
<b>Ow! What was that for?!
In the end, maybe saying
we're stuck with each other</b>

20:15.310 --> 20:17.650
<b>In the end, maybe saying
we're stuck with each other</b>

20:17.650 --> 20:19.200
<b>describes us the best.</b>

20:20.850 --> 20:24.980
<b>Our origins, our missions, our past.
None of it matters.</b>

20:25.750 --> 20:28.810
<b>We're just living, so we
can die laughing.</b>

20:32.760 --> 20:36.230
<b>And it doesn't look like this
fieldtrip-like journey</b>

20:36.230 --> 20:38.290
<b>will be ending anytime soon.</b>

20:43.440 --> 20:49.840
<b>Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru</b>

20:49.840 --> 20:55.220
<b>Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku</b>

20:55.220 --> 21:00.720
<b>Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de</b>

21:00.720 --> 21:04.120
<b>Ue o miagerunda</b>

21:04.120 --> 21:09.930
<b>Donna arifureta shiin mo enji-tsuzukeru</b>

21:09.930 --> 21:15.370
<b>Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa</b>

21:15.370 --> 21:20.670
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou</b>

21:20.670 --> 21:24.610
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:31.620 --> 21:35.290
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:35.290 --> 21:37.220
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:37.220 --> 21:41.360
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:41.360 --> 21:45.500
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:45.500 --> 21:48.170
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:48.170 --> 21:53.210
<b>Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de</b>

21:53.210 --> 21:58.610
<b>Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau</b>

21:58.610 --> 22:04.050
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou</b>

22:04.050 --> 22:08.110
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
